  {
   "id": "quest.0059C",
   "jp": "地底湖に潜むもの",
   "en": "Lake Lurker",
   "kind": "title",
   "refs": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "quest.005B0",
   "jp": "「地底湖（ちていこ）には{br}ヌシが住んでいる・・・」{br}そんなウワサが流れており、{br}人々がふあんにかられている。{br}さわぎが大きくなる前に、{br}調査（ちょうさ）してきてほしい",
   "en": "\"A beast lurks in the{br}Underground Lake...\" This rumor{br}has people worried. Please{br}investigate before the uproar{br}grows any worse.",
   "kind": "desc",
   "refs": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "quest.00658",
   "jp": "地底湖の門",
   "en": "The Lake Gate",
   "kind": "title",
   "refs": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "quest.00664",
   "jp": "ウワサのヌシがたいじされた事により{br}地底湖（ちていこ）の調査（ちょうさ）が進み、{br}そのおくに「なぞの門」が発見された。「なぞの門」の調査（ちょうさ）を{br}してきてほしい",
   "en": "With the rumored beast{br}defeated, exploration of the{br}Underground Lake has{br}progressed. A \"mysterious gate\"{br}was found deep inside. Please{br}investigate it.",
   "kind": "desc",
   "refs": 1
  },
  {
